      "item": "black pepper",
      "store_section": "Pantry/Dry Goods"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Cook bacon until crispy and crumble. Set aside.",
    "Cut iceberg lettuce through the core into 4 equal wedges. Keep core intact.",
    "Place each wedge on a plate, cut-side up.",
    "Drizzle blue cheese dressing generously over each wedge.",
    "Top with bacon, blue cheese crumbles, red onion, and chives.",
    "Finish with cracked black pepper."
